\par }{\i\cgrid0 Welcome to the demo of Commandos: Behind Enemy Lines.  Double click on the COMMANDOS.EXE file to install the demo.  The Demo will then install and run from your hard drive.  This demo features }{\b\i\cgrid0 TWO LEVELS }{\i\cgrid0 
from the final game.  }{\b\i\cgrid0 This demo will NOT run on German language systems, you will need to download the German specific version from our UK Website}{\i\cgrid0 .
\par }{\cgrid0 
